<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/empire-of-japan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Empire%20of%20Japan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Empire of Japan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">After Hiroshima, Nagasaki and Soviet entry into the war, Japan surrenders aboard USS Missouri</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-states"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20States.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United States</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The United States emerges from the Second World War as a superpower</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/french-algeria"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/French%20Algeria.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>French Algeria</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Sétif and Guelma massacres follow riots on 8 May</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/bailiwick-of-jersey"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Bailiwick%20of%20Jersey.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Bailiwick of Jersey</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Jersey is liberated on 9 May</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/soviet-union"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Soviet%20Union.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Soviet Union</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Red Army captures Berlin</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/nazi-germany"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Nazi%20Germany.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Nazi Germany</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hitler kills himself on 30 April; Germany surrenders unconditionally on 8 May</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/nguyen-dynasty"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Nguyen%20dynasty.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Nguyen dynasty</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Bao Dai abdicates to the Viet Minh on 30 August</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/french-indochina"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/French%20Indochina.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>French Indochina</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Japan overthrows French rule; Ho Chi Minh proclaims the Democratic Republic of Vietnam</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/indonesia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Indonesia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Indonesia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Sukarno and Mohammad Hatta proclaim independence on 17 August</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/shinto"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Shinto.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Shinto</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Allied occupation’s Shinto Directive ends State Shinto</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/chavin"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Chav%C3%ADn.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Chavín</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A debris flow buries much of the site and the modern town under mud</span></li></ul></section>
